 reeze\, Navarre) · 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM\n\nThe library system's lead refere
 nce specialist visits one branch each Wednesday in October to help people 
 start or extend a family tree. Visitors can bring a specific research ques
 tion or simply stop by to learn how to get started with the library's gene
 alogy resources. The help runs during regular library hours\, so no appoin
 tment time is listed.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coa
 staleventures.com/events/ev-fall-into-family-history-santa-rosa-libraries-
