DESCRIPTION:Mondays · 6:00 PM to 9:00 PM\n\nName that Tune runs free every
  Monday from 6 to 9 PM at Aces Pub\, with drink specials and prizes on the
  line for whoever names the most songs. Admission is free for all ages\, a
