  10 AM to 4 PM. It has a vendor market with local artisans and small retai
 lers\, live entertainment all day\, children's activities\, free baked goo
 ds and beverages\, and complimentary photos with Santa and Mrs. Claus. A C
 hristmas parade steps off at 1 PM\, and a 5K fun run or walk starts at 8 A
 M.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-32nd-
 annual-christmas-in-the-park-1205.html
