SUMMARY:Free Yoga at East Pensacola Heights Clubhouse (Mondays)
LOCATION:East Pensacola Heights Clubhouse\, 3208 E Gonzalez St\, Pensacola\
 , FL 32503
DESCRIPTION:Mondays · 6 PM-7 PM\n\nFree Yoga at the East Pensacola Heights
  Clubhouse is a weekly class every Monday from 6-7 PM\, led by a volunteer
  instructor\, for ages 18 and up. A trauma-informed Free PTSD Yoga class i
 s also listed at the same time and place. It's free. The paid Breathe Yoga
